 r←Test_CreateButtonForm_003(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;n;⎕TRAP;oldPixelSettings
⍝ Exercise "Dialog.Create": width test; the caption defines the width.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 oldPixelSettings←2035⌶'RealPixel'
 myGuiParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Misc\Sample.ico'))
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForYesOrNo
 parms.addToCaption←'This caption defines the actual width of the form as such'
 parms.question←'Are you really sure about this?'
 parms.buttons←'Yes' 'No'
 parms.minSize←⍬ ⍬
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateButtonForm myGuiParms parms
 ⎕DL 0.2
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.AdjustSize n

 :If ⍬ ⍬≡parms.posn
     {}n.∆Form #.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiHelpers.CenterIn myGuiParms.centerIn{(0∊⍴⍵):⍺ ⋄ ⍵}parms.centerIn
 :EndIf
 →T.GoToTidyUp∧/n.∆Form.Size∊(160+20)(450+⍳40)

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
 {}2035⌶oldPixelSettings

 r←T._OK
